OL,3,AMan dies and at least six injured after
OL,4,Asign falls at Christian festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 41-year-old man has died and at least
OL,7,Fsix other people have been injured
OL,8,Fafter reports a large sign had fallen
OL,9,Fat a Christian festival in West Sussex,
OL,10,Fpolice said.
OL,12,FSussex Police said it was called to the
OL,13,FBig Church Festival at Wiston Park,
OL,14,Fnear Steyning, at about 15:38 BST on
OL,15,FFriday.
OL,17,FAt least six people were taken to
OL,18,Fhospital for treatment, and a
OL,19,F41-year-old man, from Eastbourne, died
OL,20,Fat the scene, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
